WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.420
Your husband's here&nbsp;
to see you.

00:00:03.504 --> 00:00:04.922
What happened?

00:00:05.506 --> 00:00:06.882
I mean, how did I get here?

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:08.884
Jennifer,
you were in an accident,

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.469
and you hit your head.

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:12.804
You don't remember me,&nbsp;
do you?

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:14.181
I don't even know your name.

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:15.098
I'm Russell.

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.518
It's really nice to meet you.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:21.230
This is really our house?

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:23.148
It's been in the family
for a while.

00:00:23.232 --> 00:00:25.025
-It's so quiet.
-Better be.

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:26.902
Nearest neighbors are
over a mile away.

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:27.819
Only a mile?

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:30.197
This is Detective Page.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.782
I was wondering if your wife

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.700
would come to the station
tomorrow at 11:00

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:35.118
to talk about the accident.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:37.287
What's tomorrow at 11:00?

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:39.081
I overheard you
outside on the phone.

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:40.499
That was work calling.

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:42.709
They're wondering&nbsp;
when I was coming back.

00:00:47.548 --> 00:00:48.423
Russell?

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.427
There's someone
in the backyard!

00:00:57.683 --> 00:00:59.476
I think I'm gonna head
into town today.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.228
-You gonna be okay?
-I'll be fine.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:02.896
I feel like just need to take
a look around.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.731
Maybe something
will trigger my memory.

00:01:04.815 --> 00:01:05.857
Don't overdo it.

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:09.027
Since Jennifer had no ID,

00:01:09.111 --> 00:01:10.904
how did Russell prove
he was her husband?

00:01:10.988 --> 00:01:13.115
It says here that he showed
some family photos...

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:19.413
Jennifer and Russell?&nbsp;
That's the happy couple there.

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:23.125
If that's Russell...

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:24.668
who's that?

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.046
What did you do&nbsp;
to my husband?

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.592
This was no accident.

00:01:34.261 --> 00:01:36.930
All I have ever wanted&nbsp;
was for you to love me.

